<view class="tr-page trial-history"><block wx:if="{{activeRecord}}"><block wx:if="{{activeRecord._outcome==='selected'}}"><view class="tr-selected-hero"><text class="tr-selected-ribbon">元享好物体验官</text><text class="tr-selected-title">这份好物，
邀请你来体验！</text><text class="tr-selected-sub">你已中选本次试用</text><image class="tr-selected-gift" src="/sage_dksy/resource/red/hero.png" mode="aspectFit"/></view><view class="tr-selected-content"><view class="tr-selected-card ui-card"><view class="tr-product-row"><view class="tr-small-product"><image wx:if="{{activeRecord.trial_pro.pro_picurl&&!productImageFailed}}" src="{{activeRecord.trial_pro.pro_picurl}}" mode="aspectFill" binderror="productImageError"/><yx-icon wx:else name="gift" tone="muted" size="62"/></view><view class="tr-product-copy"><text class="tr-product-title">{{activeRecord.trial_pro.pro_title}}</text><text class="tr-product-sub">{{activeRecord.status_text}}</text></view></view><text class="tr-selected-seal">已中选</text></view><view wx:if="{{activeRecord.can_complete==1}}" class="tr-selected-next ui-card"><view><text>下一步</text><text>填写收货资料</text><text>姓名、电话和地址仅用于本次试用收货。</text></view><text class="tr-next-number">01</text></view><view class="tr-notice"><yx-icon name="info" tone="brand" size="36"/><text>请按活动要求及时提交资料。具体配送规则以本次活动说明为准。</text></view><view class="tr-privacy"><yx-icon name="shield" tone="muted" size="30"/><text>仅在中选后收集必要的收件信息</text></view><button class="ui-text-button" bindtap="closeProgress">返回我的试用</button></view><view class="tr-fixed-footer"><button wx:if="{{activeRecord.can_complete==1}}" class="ui-primary" bindtap="goComplete">填写收货资料</button><button wx:else class="ui-primary" bindtap="viewRules">查看活动规则</button></view></block><block wx:elif="{{activeRecord._outcome==='unselected'}}"><view class="ui-page tr-outcome-body"><view class="tr-unselected-art"><view class="tr-envelope"><view></view><yx-icon name="heart" tone="brand" size="64"/></view><text>本次试用结果</text></view><text class="tr-centered-title">这次，与你擦肩而过</text><text class="tr-centered-sub">很遗憾，本次试用未中选。
感谢你的参与，下一份喜欢继续发现。</text><view class="tr-outcome-card ui-card"><view class="tr-product-row"><view class="tr-small-product"><image wx:if="{{activeRecord.trial_pro.pro_picurl&&!productImageFailed}}" src="{{activeRecord.trial_pro.pro_picurl}}" mode="aspectFill" binderror="productImageError"/><yx-icon wx:else name="gift" tone="muted" size="62"/></view><view class="tr-product-copy"><text class="tr-product-title">{{activeRecord.trial_pro.pro_title}}</text><text class="tr-product-sub">{{activeRecord.status_text}}</text></view></view></view><button class="ui-primary" bindtap="goTrials">看看其他试用</button><button class="ui-text-button" bindtap="closeProgress">返回我的试用</button><view class="tr-notice"><yx-icon name="info" tone="brand" size="36"/><text>活动名额及最终结果，以实际公布信息为准。</text></view></view></block><block wx:elif="{{activeRecord._outcome==='submitted'}}"><view class="tr-result-head"><view class="tr-result-rays"></view><view class="tr-result-symbol"><yx-icon name="yes" tone="brand" size="72"/></view><text class="tr-result-kicker">向喜欢的好物，再近一步</text><text class="tr-result-title">收货资料已提交</text><text class="tr-result-sub">可以在「我的试用」查看后续进度。</text></view><view class="tr-result-content"><view class="tr-receipt ui-card"><view class="tr-ticket-cap"><text>本次试用商品</text><text class="tr-tag">资料已提交</text></view><view class="tr-product-row"><view class="tr-small-product"><image wx:if="{{activeRecord.trial_pro.pro_picurl&&!productImageFailed}}" src="{{activeRecord.trial_pro.pro_picurl}}" mode="aspectFill" binderror="productImageError"/><yx-icon wx:else name="gift" tone="muted" size="62"/></view><view class="tr-product-copy"><text class="tr-product-title">{{activeRecord.trial_pro.pro_title}}</text><text class="tr-product-sub">{{activeRecord.status_text}}</text></view></view></view><view class="tr-submitted-path"><view><view><yx-icon name="yes" tone="brand" size="28"/></view><text>资料已提交</text></view><view class="tr-path-line"></view><view><view><yx-icon name="package" tone="muted" size="30"/></view><text>查看后续进度</text></view></view><text class="tr-fulfillment-note">配送安排及处理进度，以活动实际规则和
「我的试用」显示的信息为准。</text></view><view class="tr-fixed-footer"><button class="ui-primary" bindtap="closeProgress">返回我的试用</button></view></block><block wx:else><view class="ui-page tr-outcome-body"><view class="tr-pending-orbit"><view class="tr-orbit-dot one"></view><view class="tr-orbit-dot two"></view><view class="tr-pending-circle"><yx-icon name="clock" tone="brand" size="76"/></view><text class="tr-pending-label">{{activeRecord.status_text||'状态待更新'}}</text></view><view class="tr-pending-title"><text>{{activeRecord._outcome==='pending'?'正在等待结果':'试用申请进度'}}</text><text>具体结果与后续安排，
请以本次活动的实际公布为准。</text></view><view class="tr-pending-product ui-card"><view class="tr-product-row"><view class="tr-small-product"><image wx:if="{{activeRecord.trial_pro.pro_picurl&&!productImageFailed}}" src="{{activeRecord.trial_pro.pro_picurl}}" mode="aspectFill" binderror="productImageError"/><yx-icon wx:else name="gift" tone="muted" size="62"/></view><view class="tr-product-copy"><text class="tr-product-title">{{activeRecord.trial_pro.pro_title}}</text><text class="tr-product-sub">{{activeRecord.status_text||'状态待更新'}}</text></view></view><block wx:if="{{activeRecord._outcome==='pending'}}"><view class="tr-steps"><view class="is-done"><view class="tr-step-number"><yx-icon name="yes" tone="brand" size="26"/></view><text>提交申请</text></view><view class="is-current"><view class="tr-step-number">2</view><text>等待结果</text></view><view class=""><view class="tr-step-number">3</view><text>中选收货</text></view></view></block></view><view class="tr-checklist ui-card"><text class="tr-card-title">接下来，你可以</text><button class="tr-option-row" bindtap="viewRules"><yx-icon name="gift" tone="brand" size="44"/><view><text>查看活动规则</text><text>了解本次试用的结果安排</text></view><yx-icon name="arrow" tone="muted" size="26"/></button><button class="tr-option-row" bindtap="closeProgress"><yx-icon name="order" tone="brand" size="44"/><view><text>在我的试用查看进度</text><text>中选后再完善必要收货资料</text></view><yx-icon name="arrow" tone="muted" size="26"/></button></view><button class="ui-text-button" bindtap="closeProgress">返回我的试用</button><view class="tr-fixed-footer"><button class="ui-primary" bindtap="viewRules">查看活动规则</button></view></view></block></block><view wx:else class="ui-page"><view class="tr-history-head"><text>每一次期待，都清楚可查</text><text class="tr-history-title">我的试用</text><view><text>申请记录</text><text>查看参与进度与活动结果</text></view></view><view class="tr-pill-tabs tr-history-tabs"><view class="{{prize_on===0?'active':''}}" data-tt="0" bindtap="typein">全部申请</view><view class="{{prize_on===1?'active':''}}" data-tt="1" bindtap="typein">已中选</view></view><yx-state wx:if="{{loading&&!loaded}}" type="loading"/><yx-state wx:elif="{{error&&!loaded}}" type="error" title="记录暂时没有加载出来" description="请检查网络后重试" action="重新加载" bindaction="retry"/><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="ui-error" bindtap="retry">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><view class="tr-record ui-card" wx:for="{{triallist}}" wx:key="id"><view class="tr-record-top"><text>{{item.createtime}}</text><text class="tr-tag {{item._outcome==='selected'?'gold':item._outcome==='unselected'?'gray':''}}">{{item.status_text||'状态待更新'}}</text></view><view class="tr-product-row"><view class="tr-small-product"><image wx:if="{{item.trial_pro.pro_picurl&&!item.imageFailed}}" src="{{item.trial_pro.pro_picurl}}" mode="aspectFill" binderror="imageError" data-id="{{item.id}}"/><yx-icon wx:else name="gift" tone="muted" size="62"/></view><view class="tr-product-copy"><text class="tr-product-title">{{item.trial_pro.pro_title}}</text><text class="tr-product-sub">{{item.can_complete==1?'请完善中选收货资料':item.status_text||'活动状态以实际公布为准'}}</text></view></view><view class="tr-record-bottom"><text>申请不等于中选</text><button wx:if="{{item.can_complete==1}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openProgress">填写资料 <yx-icon name="arrow" tone="brand" size="24"/></button><button wx:else data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openProgress">查看进度 <yx-icon name="arrow" tone="brand" size="24"/></button></view></view><yx-state wx:if="{{loaded&&!triallist.length}}" type="empty" title="{{prize_on===1?'还没有已公布的中选记录':'还没有试用申请记录'}}" description="报名不等于中选，具体结果以活动公布为准"/><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="tr-list-footer">正在加载…</view><button wx:elif="{{hasMore&&triallist.length}}" class="ui-text-button" bindtap="onReachBottom">继续加载</button><view wx:elif="{{triallist.length}}" class="tr-list-footer">活动结果以实际公布信息为准</view></block><button class="ui-secondary tr-top-gap" bindtap="goTrials">发现更多试用活动</button></view></view>
